OL,3,GNEWSARare Titanic items sell for
OL,4,Arecord-breaking sums
OL,5,
OL,6,FRare items belonging to passengers of
OL,7,Fthe Titanic have been sold at auction
OL,8,Ffor record-breaking sums.
OL,10,FThe highest selling artefacts were a
OL,11,Fpocket watch from third-class passenger
OL,12,FMary Mangan, which fetched #250,000,
OL,13,Fand a diamond ring worn by famous
OL,14,Fpassenger Lady Duff Gordon, which was
OL,15,Fbought for #140,000.
OL,17,FAnother item was a detailed,
OL,18,Fwater-stained letter recovered from the
OL,19,Fbody of its writer, first-class
OL,20,Fpassenger Ramon Artagaveytia Gomez,
OL,21,Fwhich was auctioned for #80,000.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
