OL,3,GNEWSARare Titanic items sell for
OL,4,Arecord-breaking sums
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuctioneer Andrew Aldridge from Henry
OL,7,FAldridge and Son in Devizes, Wiltshire,
OL,8,Fsaid the "epic sale" was evidence of
OL,9,Fthe lasting global interest in the
OL,10,Ftragic story.
